    "html": "<span class=\"fontstyle0\">【地球盟友】【柯博拉 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Cobra</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">】 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">2012 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">年 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">12 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">月 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">30 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">日讯息【</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">11:11 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">门户的第 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">11 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">道星门</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">─</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">情报更新】<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">11:11 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">门户的第 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">11 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">道星门的启动过程从 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">11 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">月 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">22 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">日就不断地进行当中。启动过程会在 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">12 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">月 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">31 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">日大功告成。届时 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">11:11 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">门户将敞开大门，并且锚定在地球表面为了开启第 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">11 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">道星门，我们收到女先知 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">Solara </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">的指示，将于格林威治时间上午 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">11 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">点 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">11 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">分和各位所在地的下午 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">1 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">点 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">11 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">分进行 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">11:11 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">结印仪式。</span><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhW_XLzKei5qouQyc9L5S4CgJ8opJ8asrA2JvagehxtV1UadzfUhUMKkVHKxqKe7qW6Gt0xzu_Uz8MIGuTDdY7AnSuz3iU2-UrAXhk0rW78QqqWAB6LGYIJs2tZ7uTgRZTL5RFrABYq9RQ/s400/1111.gif\" class=\"article-content-image\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"【地球盟友】【柯博拉 Cobra】 2012 年 12 月 30 日讯息【11:11 门户的第 11 道星门─情报更新】 配图 1\"></div><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle4\">译注</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">:</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">中国大陆、台湾、香港的时间是 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">12 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">月 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">31 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">日下午 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">1 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">点 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">11 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">分和晚上 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">7 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">点 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">11 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">分。<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p>下面是 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">11:11 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">结印仪式指南： </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">http://www.nvisible.com/1111/VideoMudras.html<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">大家可以在这个网站查询活动时间： </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">http://www.timeanddate.com/time/map/</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\" style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><br><p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">光的胜利</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">!<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">原文</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">:</span><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle3\">http://2012portal.blogspot.tw/2012/12/eleventh-gate-of-1111-update-process-of.html</span> \n<br style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; text-size-adjust: auto;\"></div></div>",
