    "html": "<font style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span class=\"fontstyle0\" style=\"\">【地球盟友】【柯博拉 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\" style=\"\">Cobra</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\" style=\"\">】 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\" style=\"\">2012 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\" style=\"\">年 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\" style=\"\">12 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\" style=\"\">月 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\" style=\"\">25 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\" style=\"\">日讯息【正面自由意志的清流】</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\" style=\"\"><br><p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\" style=\"\">虽然抉择之日当天没有达到 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\" style=\"\">144,000 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\" style=\"\">人的冥想临界质量，但我们也离这个数字相差不远。我们的集体抉择已经形成了一股强大而且正面的自由意志能量流。它永远都不会消散，而且会逐渐壮大到一个临界点。届时它将充满整颗星球，事件也会发生。</span></font><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhcPoBN16X7iyQtpAWHreampnttshLt2W-xn0jb41O2QFVG-ZZ-owkIIjZ6isneq7QMhU4OOz2AOwbA4j3pHSdCGXI0YK_hY8niVrPbYE1pHMYMDOOPhfPxkS01Iy93NBOmf1eIyfw9d50/s400/Stream.jpg\" class=\"article-content-image\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"【地球盟友】【柯博拉 Cobra】 2012 年 12 月 25 日讯息【正面自由意志的清流】 配图 1\"></div><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><font style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span class=\"fontstyle3\" style=\"\">刚好在我们集体冥想之后，太阳喷发出一股大规模的太阳耀斑： </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\" style=\"\">http://www.space.com/18179-major-solar-flare-sun-storm-erupts.html</span></font></div><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><font style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span class=\"fontstyle3\" style=\"\">几天之后，网络上出现了一则科技新闻，技术前景相当看好：<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle4\" style=\"\">http://americankabuki.blogspot.com/2012/10/noble-gas-plasma-engine-to-revealed-at.html<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\" style=\"\">最近几天，我们对光的胜利的集体抉择受到了星光层负面实体的考验。但我们集<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p>体的正面的自由意志已经强大到可以抵消所有的负面影响。人类意识的清流平稳又坚定地在地球的光网格之中流动。<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p>原文</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\" style=\"\">:</span></font><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle4\"><font style=\"font-size: 18px;\">http://2012portal.blogspot.tw/2012/10/stream-of-positive-free-will-although.html</font></span> \n<br style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; text-size-adjust: auto;\"></div></div></div>",
