    "html": "<span class=\"fontstyle0\">【地球盟友】【柯博拉 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Cobra</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">】 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">2012 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">年 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">12 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">月 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">18 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">日讯息【接触之日的最后更新】<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">我们能开启开户</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">!</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">这将会是新循环的开始</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">!</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">让我们一起努力</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">: http://2012portal.blogspot.com/2012/12/make-thisviral-day-of-contact-12-21.html</span><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle3\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle3\">这里有各种语言版本的冥想指南</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">: </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">（已省略，可上网查原文）<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p>原文</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">:</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle4\">http://2012portal.blogspot.tw/2012/12/day-of-contact-last-update-we-will-open.html</span> \n<br style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; text-size-adjust: auto;\"></div>",
