    "html": "<span class=\"fontstyle0\">【地球盟友】【柯博拉 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Cobra</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">】 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">2012 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">年 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">11 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">月 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">26 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">日讯息【拉古纳会议的简短成果报告】<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">拉古纳会议的参与人数十分浩大。当天亲爱的星际兄弟姊妹们透过光束飞船现身，好几名与会民众获得了第一次接触的目击经验。大家可以到 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">AmericanKabuk </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">的网志阅读当天的目击报告</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">:</span><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle4\">http://americankabuki.blogspot.com/2012/11/ufo-over-laguna-beach-california.html<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">这是另一篇网志</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">:</span><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle4\">http://americankabuki.blogspot.com/2012/11/welcome-galactics.html</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgfFYCOYNJ9P19HlskaZ4FcnzkNvlTsAEnbzXwSQ2JGbBSHKGHDMc8bmpMVqNpCvThr9l2ijbgtONByuqRetDszUHKa2rEpU-avJ6tCMHDeLRiD8SIao3d2rqFENyaxt6lmSNvlc6xuC0M/s400/Angel7.jpg\" class=\"article-content-image\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"【地球盟友】【柯博拉 Cobra】 2012 年 11 月 26 日讯息【拉古纳会议的简短成果报告】 配图 1\"></div><span class=\"fontstyle4\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">我们已经开启了 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">11:11 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">门户。我们在会议期间让原本雾茫茫的天气转晴。我们把<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p>拉古纳调整到完美状态。光的胜利</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">!<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">原文</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">:</span><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle4\">http://2012portal.blogspot.tw/2012/11/a-short-notice-about-laguna-conference.html</span> \n<br style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; text-size-adjust: auto;\"></div></div></div>",
