    "html": "<span class=\"fontstyle0\">【地球盟友】【柯博拉 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Cobra</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">】 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">2012 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">年 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">11 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">月 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">22 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">日讯息【</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">11:11 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">门户第十一道星门开启情报更新】<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">前所未见的钻石之门如今悉现在前。 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">11:11 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">的门廊将会永远敞开。这是我们通往合一的维度之桥。回家的路就在眼前。<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p>原文</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">:</span><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle4\" style=\"font-size:9pt;\">http://2012portal.blogspot.tw/2012/11/eleventh-gate-activation-update-diamond.html</span> \n<br style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; text-size-adjust: auto;\"></div>",
