    "html": "<span class=\"fontstyle0\">【地球盟友】【柯博拉 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Cobra</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">】 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">2012 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">年 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">11 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">月 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">20 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">日讯息【</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">11:11 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">第 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">11 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">道星门开启冥想的最后更新】<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">第 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">11 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">道星门开启冥想已经近在眼前。让我们一起努力</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">!</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">让我们合力打开进入合一的大门</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">!</span><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjd7rbsDF9GJr9AwUuOBl119oDkfeBXhPe5DtyEnsU9rP9AKbG-8lLxQHWomC-Xf5eStS3vdiIeQg2U2ndEWd_I3gEtQwoWoPUdG2tWRxRO0YXc1g9Z6AvsPtEj4dl5RIPa0toQeksz_o0/s400/Wave1111.jpg\" class=\"article-content-image\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"【地球盟友】【柯博拉 Cobra】 2012 年 11 月 20 日讯息【11:11 第 11 道星门开启冥想的最后更新】 配图 1\"></div><span class=\"fontstyle4\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">第 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">11 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">道星门开启的时候，许多微型的棱柱星门就会永远锚定在地球现实世界和非实体世界的矩阵裂缝。卡拉比－丘流形在 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">5 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">维</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">-7 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">维的所有面向都会形成一个完美的球体</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">/</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">一个完美的泡泡。届时 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">8 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">维世界将会开始往下锚定。前所未见的钻石将会首度亮相。<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p>原文</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">:</span><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle4\">http://2012portal.blogspot.tw/2012/11/final-eleventh-gate-activation-update.html</span> \n<br style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; text-size-adjust: auto;\"></div></div>",
