    "html": "<span class=\"fontstyle0\">【地球盟友】【柯博拉 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Cobra</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">】 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">2012 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">年 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">11 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">月 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">15 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">日讯息【</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">11:11 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">第十一道星门开启冥想的情报更新】<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">第十一道星门的开启日期正在快速接近。大家对这次活动的响应程度尚未达到我们预期的水平。第十一</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">道星门是二元性世界的完结点，因此这是一次非常重要的全球性开启仪式。我再次呼吁大家尽可能踊跃参与。<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p>这是关于这次开启冥想的 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">Youtube </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">短片： </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">http://www.youtube.com/watch?feature=player_embedded&amp;v=Gp5UhUcC1xI</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">这是由 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">Solara </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">创建的，开启冥想的官方脸书社团： </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">http://www.facebook.com/events/165509883585846/<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">这里是另一个开启冥想的脸书社团，由柯博拉的支持者们创建的： </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">http://www.facebook.com/events/275560819232036/<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">另外，这是开启冥想的所有相关细节的连结： </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">http://2012portal.blogspot.com/2012/11/makethis-viral-eleventh-gate-1111.html<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">原文</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">:</span><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle4\">http://2012portal.blogspot.tw/2012/11/eleventh-gate-activation-update-time.html</span> \n<br style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; text-size-adjust: auto;\"></div>",
