    "html": "<span class=\"fontstyle0\">【地球盟友】【柯博拉 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Cobra</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">】 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">2012 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">年 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">11 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">月 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">04 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">日讯息【有趣的进展】<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">光明势力在这礼拜有大有斩获。当前幕后发生了许多需要保密的事情，不过有几件事情是已经曝光的。</span><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><br><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjXV_YHi6-h6yV230DXdAvE5DoRklE0bYAM73DYvW7_fzQLYc6k84DM2g3NWrUVaPkffv4gueTkedudlOAFtYcNIZmZdb6wsoWhoqJqMRyugoLsxTb1uJoCo2QmLqka9D151puXZa4DcF0/s400/Heaven.jpg\" class=\"article-content-image\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"【地球盟友】【柯博拉 Cobra】 2012 年 11 月 04 日讯息【有趣的进展】 配图 1\"></div><span class=\"fontstyle3\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p>首先，修复世界计划有一个重要部分已经告一段落：<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">http://hopegirl2012.wordpress.com/2012/11/04/what-you-have-be en-waiting-for-the-fix-the-world-project-results/<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">另外关阴谋集团前黑预算项目，下面有一篇相当好的概论文章：</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\" style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><br><p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle4\" style=\"font-size:9pt;\">http://projectcamelotportal.com/kerrys-blog/1404-black-projects-follow-the-money<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">请大家注意，该文章中的大部分内容都是十年以前的事情。抵抗运动已经在几年前就清理了阴谋集团所有的地下军事基地。所有相关项目也已经随之而去。<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p>下文是关于桑迪台风的副作用： </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">http://buzz.money.cnn.com/2012/11/02/stock-certificates-sandy/<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">下面这篇通灵讯息对自己的出生证明提出了有趣的看法：<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">http://soundofheart.org/galacticfreepress/content/great-dissolution-2012-message-sananda-through-beth-trutwin<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">原文</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">:</span><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle4\">http://2012portal.blogspot.tw/2012/11/interesting-developments-this-weekend.html</span> \n<br style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; text-size-adjust: auto;\"></div></div></div>",
