    "html": "<font style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span class=\"fontstyle0\" style=\"\">【地球盟友】【柯博拉 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\" style=\"\">Cobra</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\" style=\"\">】 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\" style=\"\">2012 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\" style=\"\">年 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\" style=\"\">10 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\" style=\"\">月 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\" style=\"\">30 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\" style=\"\">日讯息【修复世界计划的重要更新】</span></font><p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p><font style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span class=\"fontstyle3\" style=\"\">修复世界计划现在快速成长。它已经转交到负责释放各项基金的人物和组织。另外它也需要公开在网络上，让人们都能了解进度。</span></font><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgT7b0nQj_jg3Fc0uO7RswBM3xeCNgYA3MZ7FGkXquX1tbnXHqYydef17qS5DB-FJkHUTmBFd-zxHCdqu-LIGWlo_Sr-n5t90SSbhizJG0fvCa07CX61z0gFRSajFQvKyxnjoIClPNflH0/s400/LoveNotGreed.jpg\" class=\"article-content-image\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"【地球盟友】【柯博拉 Cobra】 2012 年 10 月 30 日讯息【修复世界计划的重要更新】 配图 1\"></div><font style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span class=\"fontstyle3\" style=\"\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p>修复世界计划短期内会有更多的连带项目。不过下方文章是即时消息，所剩时间已经越来越短，现在就必须把它发布出来：<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">http://hopegirl2012.wordpress.com/2012/10/29/from-the-people-for-the-peo ple-of-earth-phase-one-how-to/<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\" style=\"\">下方是这项计划的基本介绍：<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">http://hopegirl2012.wordpress.com/2012/09/10/this-is-how-we-fix-the-world-by-hopegirl/</span></font><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">附：文章更新已经下架。</div><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><font style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span class=\"fontstyle3\" style=\"\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p>原因解释如下：&nbsp;</span></font><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><font style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span class=\"fontstyle4\">http://hopegirl2012.wordpress.com/2012/11/01/an-apology-to-my-beloved-readers/<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\" style=\"\">原文</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">:</span></font><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle4\"><font style=\"font-size: 18px;\">http://2012portal.blogspot.tw/2012/10/important-update-about-fixing-world.html</font></span> \n<br style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; text-size-adjust: auto;\"></div></div></div></div>",
