    "paragraphs": [],
    "html": "<span class=\"fontstyle0\">【地球盟友】【柯博拉 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Cobra</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">】 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">2012 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">年 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">10 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">月 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">29 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">日讯息【杜里诺门户会议的简短成果报告】<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">杜里诺门户会议真的是妙不可言</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">!</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">我们让下雨天变成放晴的好天气</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">!</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">光的胜利</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">!<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">一张图胜过千言万语。这张照片是星期五会议当天在莫斯科出现的飞船</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">:</span><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh7gpGvnFr63CUjpwUFnbhcvthMsO1CvrMBAaMdieA-3ZJ3ajGLh_CusHB5ou5E73e3IKsS1bwRN25QjZQB7ZluDFu7VQoEdH0eSm8HgsKTFXEjsitzZh5kkUSEGYhkiPc1xOoMFdlp6P8/s400/UFO.jpg\" class=\"article-content-image\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"【地球盟友】【柯博拉 Cobra】 2012 年 10 月 29 日讯息【杜里诺门户会议的简短成果报告】 配图 1\"></div><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle3\">这是会议过后星期一在杜里诺的日出</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">:</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle4\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjQDcUnCPVen_FnQ_w5OVrlsSw2L_PvHbj0etxkVOWP3NTV5GBGmZFdABaGyTeRP9XmfhQ55lRQ3Gy8nQObbz5Ab5Pf6eJDLuVqwuSOOCpW5Em7FUaAtQciPMzWpfOjGstoYuqJ-gWAjSQ/s400/Sunrise.jpg\" class=\"article-content-image\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"【地球盟友】【柯博拉 Cobra】 2012 年 10 月 29 日讯息【杜里诺门户会议的简短成果报告】 配图 2\"></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle4\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">感受图片的能量吧</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">!</span><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle4\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">原文</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">:</span><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle4\">http://2012portal.blogspot.tw/2012/10/blog-post_29.html</span> \n<br style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; text-size-adjust: auto;\"></div></div></div></div></div>",
