    "html": "<span class=\"fontstyle0\">【地球盟友】【柯博拉 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Cobra</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">】 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">2012 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">年 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">6 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">月 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">20 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">日讯息【世界解放运动</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">—</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">情报更新】<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">我们能做到！我们能让地球重获自由！请大家聚精会神，持续进行每周解放冥想，直到我们解放地球！<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p>脸书和 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">Youtube </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">已经因为我们的努力而乱成一团。我收到许多网友反应他们无法加入我们的脸书活动页面。我们的 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">Youtube </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">短片也被禁播，特别是在德国和日本。请选择其它同样可行的方式来宣传冥想讯息。以<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p>下是我们每周解放冥想的脸书活动页面和短片</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">:http://www.facebook.com/events/346035828798386/</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">、<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FjXIstvQeKo<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">还有我们夏至冥想的脸书活动页面： </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">http://www.facebook.com/events/292921614138147/</span><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle3\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle3\">原文</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">:</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle4\">http://2012portal.blogspot.tw/2012/06/normal-0-microsoftinternetexplorer4_20.html</span> \n<br style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; text-size-adjust: auto;\"></div>",
