    "html": "<span class=\"fontstyle0\">【地球盟友】【柯博拉 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Cobra</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">】 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">2012 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">年 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">6 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">月 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">17 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">日讯息【昴宿星人、抵抗运动和事件】<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">大家或许会想收听德雷克最近的访问，特别是 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">35 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">到 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">42 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">分钟的内容：<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle4\"><font style=\"font-size: 15px;\">http://www.blogtalkradio.com/global-voice-radio-network/2012/06/17/drake-vital-updates–june-16-2012&nbsp;</font></span><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle3\">也可以看关于阴谋集团投降条款的短片：<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p>昴宿星人、其他正面外星种族和抵抗运动正密切监控着地球局势。阴谋集团得在 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">6 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">月 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">21 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">日前透过大众媒体公开投降。如果他们投降的话，地球局势就会自然而然地发展。如果他们拒绝投降的话，昴宿星人和抵抗运动就会立即实施反制计划。计划具体执行的方式一部分取决于正义军在未来几天的行动。<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p>正面的外星势力正在确保着地球在近期内不会发生灾难性事件，他们也会在任何类似状况发生前进行介入。<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p>大家可以收听我最近的访问，可以更了解地球局势的来龙去脉：<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">http://kauilapele.wordpress.com/2012/06/13/the -light-agenda-with-cobra-6-13-12-mp3s/</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">访问的 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">Youtube </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">连结：<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p>或者阅读文字记录</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">:</span><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle4\" style=\"font-size:9pt;\">http://the2012scenario.com/2012/06/transcript-of-stephen-cooks-exclusive-interview-with-cobra-june-13-2012-part-12/<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">有趣的是， </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">Kauilapele </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">的部落格发表我的访问之后，当天网站刚好达成 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">20000 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">次的点击率：<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">http://kauilapele.wordpress.com/2012/06/14/exactly-20000-views-on-6-13-12/<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">这毫无疑问是神圣介入的象征！世界上有着比我们所有人都更强大的势力，并且他们正努力确保圣光会在地球上胜利。<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p>原文</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">:</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle4\"><font style=\"font-size: 15px;\">http://2012portal.blogspot.tw/2012/06/normal-0-microsoftinternetexplorer4_17.html</font></span> \n<br style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; text-size-adjust: auto;\"></div></div>",
