    "id": "local-1788667754525",
    "title": "【地球盟友】【柯博拉 Cobra】 2012 年 6 月 9 日讯息【光明与黑暗的栅格比】",
    "category": "门户更新",
    "date": "2012-06-09",
    "cover": "assets/articles/cobra-archive/2012-06-09-1ad6fe9c58/cover.jpg",
    "excerpt": "",
    "hot": 80,
    "commentMode": "all",
