    "id": "local-1788667346173",
    "title": "【地球盟友】【柯博拉 Cobra】 2012 年 6 月 6 日讯息【重大消息:阴谋集团和平投降的谈判】",
    "category": "门户更新",
    "date": "2012-06-06",
    "cover": "assets/articles/cobra-archive/2012-06-06-56072023cc/cover.jpg",
    "excerpt": "",
