    "html": "<span class=\"fontstyle0\">【地球盟友】【柯博拉 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Cobra</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">】 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">2012 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">年 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">6 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">月 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">6 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">日讯息【重大消息</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">:</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">阴谋集团和平投降的谈判】<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">德雷克希望人民对黑暗阴谋集团</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">/</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">银行家族该如何投降以及投降条件的提案进行投票。我们的诉求是什么？现在的选项有</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">:</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">发动全面战争，剿灭银行家族。或者与黑暗阴谋集团进行谈判，然后过渡到一个和平的新自由社会。<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p>大家（人民）想要全面战争吗？如果是的话，军队将发动战争，对抗阴谋集团</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">/</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">银行家的雇佣军和效忠者。战斗双方都会出现很多死伤。双方都希望不流血的转变。所以我们需要编写一套方案，让转变能够和平发生。<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p>这里有更多的信息：&nbsp;</span><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle4\">http://www.ascensionwithearth.com/2012/05/drake-notes-updated-for-april-29th-2012.html<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">一旦资料整理好了，我就会在接下来的 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">12 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">个小时内发布抵抗运动的对于谈判的官方声明。<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle5\">附注：大家可以在这里听到德雷克的发言：&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle4\">http://thecritical-post.com/blog/2012/06/global-voice-radio-show-with-drake-662012-6-june-2012-1900-hrs-edt-the -cabal-is-looking-for-terms-nesara-tcpchicago/<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">请先听完节目，然后在文章后面发表评论。<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p>原文</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">:</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle4\">http://2012portal.blogspot.tw/2012/06/breaking-news.html</span> \n<br style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; text-size-adjust: auto;\"></div>",
    "archived": false,
    "archivedAt": "",
