    "images": [],
    "paragraphs": [],
    "html": "<span class=\"fontstyle0\">【地球盟友】【柯博拉 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Cobra</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">】 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">2012 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">年 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">5 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">月 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">12 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">日讯息【世界解放日之后的集体冥想】<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">冥想指南</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">:</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\" style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><br><p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">1.</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">身心放松，用几分钟关注自己的呼吸。<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">2.</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">观想警政单位逮捕中央银行罪犯</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">:</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">罗斯柴尔德和洛克菲勒，以及阴谋集团的其他成员。例如</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">:</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">亨利</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">•</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">基辛格。观想这个过程在全世界和平、顺利地进行。观想我们的世界终于从金融奴役中重获自由。观想全人类摆脱了所有邪恶独裁者和腐败政客；恢复自由。<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">3.</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">观想人类光明的、崭新的美好未来。公平的新金融系统正式上线。所有债务都完全免除。人道主义项目的繁荣基金开始改善人类的生活。先进的高等科技逐渐问世。生态系统完全恢复活力。人类终于从所有的压迫中自由。<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p>冥想时间</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">:</span><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle4\">5 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">月 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">13 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">日星期日&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle3\">纽约 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">11:00AM&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle3\">伦敦 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">4:00PM&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle3\">巴黎 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">5:00PM&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle3\">雅典 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">6:00PM<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">脸书社团</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">:http://www.facebook.com/events/353351221391688/<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">原文</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">:</span><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle4\">http://2012portal.blogspot.tw/2012/05/continuing-unified-meditation-for-world.html</span> \n<br style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; text-size-adjust: auto;\"></div></div>",
