    "html": "<span class=\"fontstyle0\">【地球盟友】 【柯博拉 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Cobra</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">】 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">2012 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">年 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">4 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">月 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">22 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">日讯息【日本免除缅甸 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">37 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">亿美元的债务</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">─</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">感谢白龙会！】<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">日本在这个星期六宣布将会免除缅甸 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">37 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">亿美元的债务，并重启开发援助计划；进而支持缅甸的民主和经济改革。<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p>日本首相野田佳彦和缅甸总统吴登盛会晤结束，缅甸政府方面正式宣布了这项消息；随即登场的是湄公河五国领袖高峰会。<p style=\"color: rgb(35, 48, 103); font-family: &quot; Microsoft YaHei&quot; , &quot; PingFang SC&quot; , Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; line-height: 34.2px; text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p>下方连结有更多的细节（ </span><span class=\"fontstyle5\">已省略，可上网查原文</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">）</span><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><font color=\"#273066\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">http://www.usnews.com/news/world/articles/2012/04/21/japan-to-forgive-37-billion-of-myanmars-debt&nbsp;</font></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><b style=\"color: rgb(55, 214, 225); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><br></b></div><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle3\">原文： </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">http://2012portal.blogspot.tw/2012/04/japan-forgives-3.html</span></div></div></div>",
