    "id": "local-1788608221580",
    "title": "【地球盟友】 【柯博拉 Cobra】 2012 年 4 月 13 日讯息【神圣干预闪焰】",
    "category": "门户更新",
    "date": "2012-04-13",
    "cover": "assets/articles/cobra-archive/2012-04-13-8ea6153ed9/cover.jpg",
    "excerpt": "",
    "hot": 80,
    "commentMode": "all",
    "contentType": "article",
    "duration": "",
    "music": "",
    "video": "",
    "sourceDoc": "",
    "sourcePdf": "",
    "images": [],
    "paragraphs": [],
    "html": "<div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle0\">【地球盟友】 【柯博拉 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Cobra</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">】 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">2012 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">年 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">4 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">月 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">13 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">日讯息【神圣干预闪焰】</span></div><span class=\"fontstyle0\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">2012 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">年 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">4 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">月 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">13 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">日星期五，今天神圣本源直接朝着地球表面发送了一道能量闪焰。这束能量柱会清理旧的能量，并且确保未来解放地球的工作能顺利圆满成功。这种胶粒子波的量子泡沫特征变得更加和谐。简单的说，往后的地球将会迎来更多神圣光柱。</span><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><br><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhPeDrry3jvUIxh26AE5f9ml2f5GmiumNQfwYKPGdDlNY_h8KqQ0JLuq8UblB6VCzkM_x_Iy5lJJlfAcAJY1TDBIxQDivrA4lDnv6zQcOIZ0z-gu73yn7RwVSD2QT1NlqnwMNH73CSI0HM/s400/Spacewarp2.jpg\" class=\"article-content-image\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"【地球盟友】 【柯博拉 Cobra】 2012 年 4 月 13 日讯息【神圣干预闪焰】 配图 1\"></div><span class=\"fontstyle4\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p>火星顺行在这星期五顺行可能有很重大的意涵。因为从 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">1 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">月 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">23 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">日开始，火星逆行导致了许多的延迟、焦躁不安，以及大家明显缺乏行动。所以说呢，大家不久就会看到很多的行动登场</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">!<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">同时，水星在 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">4 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">月 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">16 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">日进入白羊宫。这暗示着之后会有更多的行动；更多的好消息。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle4\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEivV2XrKUOfLErONB879_p6b8vEtJ2G_RQpQjePQ7o6Org8dev0RlWHSCJcoP5ovRHbMpZpPRIJYP6ZKRwSvMEr2xQjmO3_hYrK8bFiTlwgMMsAMw7PnapBXXRvVxCEiVjtkTzsBc2QeqU/s400/Sheliak.jpg\" class=\"article-content-image\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"【地球盟友】 【柯博拉 Cobra】 2012 年 4 月 13 日讯息【神圣干预闪焰】 配图 2\"></div><span class=\"fontstyle4\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">Sheliak </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">时间波运算函数，是目前测量零点时间波异常现象中最准确的工具。它在 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">4 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">月 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">17 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">日达到峰值，之后它会慢慢地、稳定地减缓，直到</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">2012 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">年 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">12 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">月 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">21 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">日。我们希望有越来越多的</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">“</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">真相大白</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">”</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">，直到地球完全重获自由的那一天。<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p>原文</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">:</span><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle3\"><font style=\"font-size: 14px;\">http://2012portal.blogs</font><font style=\"font-size: 14px;\">pot.tw/2012/04/divine-intervention-flash-april-13th.html</font></span> \n<br style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; text-size-adjust: auto;\"></div></div></div>",
    "archived": false,
    "archivedAt": "",
    "coverMobile": "assets/articles/cobra-archive/2012-04-13-8ea6153ed9/cover-mobile.webp",
    "deleted": false
