    "html": "<div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle0\">【地球盟友】【柯博拉 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Cobra</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">】 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">2012 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">年 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">4 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">月 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">1 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">日讯息【女神回归：金星在 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">4 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">月初接<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p>近昴宿星团】<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">这是有史以来，昴宿星团的宇宙女神能量第一次与人类的女神能量合而为一。人类整体意识中的女神总算可以喘口气，出门追寻星星的奥妙了。这个天文事件是 </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">2012</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">年玛雅预言里面一个很重要的部份。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><span class=\"fontstyle3\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p>大家可以在四月初日落之后看到金星接近昴宿星团。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhw8EGqKQPcRDthjiJ5gdMqRXMVjfY8CGbqr-qkFtjY4Y0JfioqPCySGQQ7RGAjBo_cRhaIaybXpVF_L7iilbdb2RosBgDvrC5_JqMCQOL9-vBwoDJ8KpNiz_xKDos7MTl8arhyphenhyphenM66RAgk/s320/VenusPleiades2.jpg\" class=\"article-content-image\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"【地球盟友】【柯博拉 Cobra】 2012 年 4 月 1 日讯息【女神回归：金星在 4 月初接 配图 1\"></div><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEihxz2AlCj1NJwFJmnnBFjW5o4bDh2ZdB15MhPhtCr0DqvuClMU3Hqbn8VvK_pDAlAP_Gm_7XJDFn2LWgOhvaqq2P4-3_kw5vQ4NWc4dmqdtK1hJrH8vFPk_dKS9qfOp4RHc1UqgtDT4-s/s200/VenusPleiades3.jpg\" class=\"article-content-image\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"【地球盟友】【柯博拉 Cobra】 2012 年 4 月 1 日讯息【女神回归：金星在 4 月初接 配图 2\"></div><span class=\"fontstyle3\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; text-align-last: auto; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\"></p>原文</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">:http://2012portal.blogspot.tw/2012/04/return-of-goddess-venus-pleiades.html</span> \n<br style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; text-size-adjust: auto;\"></div></div>",
